        "openmrs_entity_id": "",
        "type": "toaster_notes",
        "text": "Ushauri: Muuaji wa Kimya\n\nNi jambo jema sana kwamba unahisi vizuri! Hata hivyo, Kisukari na Shinikizo la Damu ni magonjwa ya maisha yote \u2014 yanayojulikana kama 'wauaji wa kimya' kwa sababu yanasababisha uharibifu mkubwa moyoni, figo, na macho \u2014 hata bila dalili zozote.\n\nKuacha dawa unapohisi vizuri ni kosa la hatari zaidi. Dawa yako inasaidia kudhibiti shinikizo la damu na sukari ya damu. Bila dawa, uharibifu unaendelea bila kujua.\n\nTafadhali endelea kuchukua dawa yako kila siku.",
        "toaster_type": "warning",
        "relevance": {
          "rules-engine": {
            "ex-rules": {
              "rules-file": "rule/ncd_followup_clinical_adherence_relevance.yml"
            }
